{
 "voice": "Cori (Piper en_GB-cori-high)",
 "lines": {
  "Take a slow breath in, and let it go.": "66000b86a704.mp3",
  "Welcome. Let's take a moment to slow down.": "cb076e42e113.mp3",
  "Now breathe in through your nose for four, and out slowly for six. Let the out-breath be longer.": "20c35fe3f674.mp3",
  "Let your breathing return to its own pace.": "b3a50e6ac6ac.mp3",
  "Notice how you feel now, compared with a few minutes ago. Take that calm with you.": "2ddf0446406f.mp3",
  "Sit comfortably, and let your shoulders drop away from your ears.": "6eb1afa7503e.mp3",
  "First, two double breaths. In through the nose, then a little more, then a long sigh out.": "1633de376386.mp3",
  "If your mind wanders, that's fine. Just come back to the next breath.": "ee8be0f21f5f.mp3",
  "Let's steady the rhythm. In for four, hold for four, out for four, hold for four.": "88444ca6c06c.mp3",
  "And back to long, easy exhales.": "44aa48f93338.mp3",
  "Welcome. Find a comfortable position, and close your eyes if you like.": "6c5c71ee26c2.mp3",
  "Take a few slow breaths to arrive.": "3ae73536c639.mp3",
  "Bring to mind something that's been weighing on you. Ask yourself: which part of this is actually up to me? My effort, my words, my attitude. Let the rest go, just for now.": "bec94548e1f4.mp3",
  "Come back to your breath, and to the room around you.": "0e7454b642a6.mp3",
  "When you are ready, carry one of these thoughts into the rest of your day.": "0be2b0ddf7ff.mp3",
  "Picture yourself from above, sitting right where you are. Now rise higher. See your street, your city, the curve of the earth. Most of what felt big today is very small from up here.": "a797d2cb0613.mp3",
  "Think of one person who made your life a little better recently. Picture their face, and silently thank them.": "1d2ea86b7f50.mp3",
  "Everything changes. This mood, this difficulty, even this good moment, will pass. Hold today lightly.": "75d3798f3465.mp3",
  "Ask yourself: who do I want to be tomorrow? Choose one quality. Patience, courage, kindness. Picture yourself acting with it.": "9a589e5ae3e8.mp3",
  "Right now, millions of people are also breathing, also trying their best. You are part of something much larger than today.": "415492d3d795.mp3",
  "Welcome. Sit tall, feet flat on the floor, hands resting on your thighs.": "d8ded72a34b8.mp3",
  "Take a slow breath in, and let it out.": "2db454295706.mp3",
  "Lift your shoulders up toward your ears. Hold for a moment.": "e6fc45ee6abf.mp3",
  "And let them fall.": "65fbfea69480.mp3",
  "Now close your eyes and scan down from the top of your head. Your forehead, your jaw. Let them soften.": "33d856ca028c.mp3",
  "Your shoulders, your chest, your belly. Let them soften.": "de8d84f7df04.mp3",
  "Your hips, your legs, all the way down to your feet.": "59d09e0f9028.mp3",
  "Take one more deep breath in, and let it all go.": "732bfd2c6176.mp3",
  "Notice how your body feels now.": "b94a039eefad.mp3",
  "Gently drop your right ear toward your right shoulder. Breathe into the left side of your neck.": "75d95b93c298.mp3",
  "Slowly bring your head through the middle, and over to the left.": "ea75fd2b65cb.mp3",
  "And back to center.": "91c6674c3c3a.mp3",
  "Reach your right arm overhead and lean gently to the left. Feel the stretch along your side.": "24f8f21c0a15.mp3",
  "Come back up, and reach the other arm over to the right.": "cc6cc73097af.mp3",
  "Place your left hand on your right knee and twist gently to the right. Look over your shoulder.": "bf936f0a7348.mp3",
  "Come back to center, and twist to the other side.": "d62f6d811f0d.mp3",
  "Now fold forward slowly, letting your arms and head hang heavy.": "b5c3645f1450.mp3",
  "Roll up one vertebra at a time, head last.": "32f0b27b8384.mp3",
  "Welcome. Get comfortable, and let your body be heavy.": "9fce32a00e28.mp3",
  "There's nothing left to do today.": "a4c21202392c.mp3",
  "We'll breathe in for four, hold for seven, and breathe out slowly for eight.": "eb9bf7a137e8.mp3",
  "Keep breathing slowly. Drift off whenever you are ready.": "29bfe1e993bf.mp3",
  "Let your jaw loosen. Let your eyes soften.": "143526bca845.mp3",
  "Feel the bed holding you up. You don't have to hold anything.": "ccc648f56f6c.mp3",
  "If thoughts about today come up, picture setting each one down on a shelf. They'll be there tomorrow.": "303eb2de9df9.mp3",
  "Now just breathe naturally, and count each out-breath, from ten down to one.": "924fe110a4b7.mp3",
  "Breathe in": "5f140e42337d.mp3",
  "And slowly out": "8de29927b3bd.mp3",
  "In": "aef36502d67b.mp3",
  "A little more": "c563b47bf9f7.mp3",
  "Long sigh out": "a7c068e4a4c2.mp3",
  "Hold": "3bd32832287a.mp3",
  "Out": "220e06ba2fee.mp3",
  "And out, slowly": "80b79f2df98a.mp3"
 }
